      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“要是有，就用不着为难了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If there were someone, I would not be in such a bind.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00436",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "驹子断然地说。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Komako said firmly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00436",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“不过他说，只要我在这个地方，就不许我跟别人结婚，不然就不择手段地加以破坏。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But he said that as long as I stay in this place, he will not let me marry anyone else, and if I try, he will stop it by any means.",
          "g": "predicate"
